Vendored dependency: pdfio, with its ttf library

  Upstream:      https://github.com/michaelrsweet/pdfio
  Version:       1.6.5
  Commit:        5102eddff28d9b605f3e6783d50ad380f61f692e
  Archive:       https://github.com/michaelrsweet/pdfio/releases/download/v1.6.5/pdfio-1.6.5.tar.gz
